"Moon Thegund's chaos index rose for months and hit its limit weeks before the outbreak."
"Yipalck evacuated its own staff by ship; Worli Ro-den's loyal assistants were left behind."
"A demon bug swarm struck the Elepta farm and its region, a red zone at the center of the map."
"Moon Thegund's System failed entirely, cutting teleports and calls for everyone."
"Most non-Avowed caught in the red zone died; Thenn-ar and several scientists were killed."
"Alden Thorn and the child Kibby survived in Ro-den's lab, sheltering in a runed vault."
"The Systems officially class it a Thegund Class corrupted environment."
"The Contracts estimated capable rescue would take 8 to 14 months to reach Elepta."
"Wizard ships from the Mother clear chaos zones slowly, two steps forward and one back."
"On about day 152 a cleared half-circle appeared at the far edge of the chaos map."
"Around day 186 Kibby's bomb destroyed Ro-den's lab, and Alden and Kibby fled by car."
"Alden then carried Kibby on foot until they reached the cleared zone."
"Knight Alis-art'h, the Quaternary, was sent by the Grand Senate and Triformed the corruption."
"Thegund's Contract collapsed entirely and had to be rebuilt over several months."
"Alis-art'h sent the dying Alden to Artona I by the Ritual of Return."
"Worli Ro-den was hauled off Thegund by the authorities after the incident."
"Thegund's System had been half-broken since before Earth became a resource world."
"The Triplanets asked no silence about it; it went largely unpublicized on Earth."
"News that a System broke spread among Avowed, since Systems are not supposed to break."
"Ro-den's assistants could have taken a flyer to Chayklo any time before corruption broke through."
"They only had to agree not to continue or share his research; Ro-den said otherwise."
"Ro-den had broken all their secrecy contracts, claiming they could build a new artificial demon."
"Ro-den's Thegund lab aimed to make an artificial demon; its eighteenth version had a prepared body."
"It also held a demonic sample from Gathos; a lab mishap lost both and ruined the vault."
"Ro-den's lab had smuggled bombs, using a weak spot in the Earth Contract."
